<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1865"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Moondog<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Moondog<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, December 14, 2004 - 12:31 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Excellent Mark - thanks for the hard work.  My eyes and mind aren&#39;t as keen as yours but I&#39;ll try to take a closer look tonight and see if I find anything. <BR> <BR>Take care, <BR>Moondog<!--/Text--></td></tr>
